2026-02-23 12:41:28,284 INFO 35570 [egg-sequelize](5ms) Executed (default): SELECT w.id, w.name, w.slug, w.url, w.icon_url AS iconUrl, w.description, w.click_count AS clickCount,
              w.create_time AS createTime, c.name AS category
       FROM uied_website w
       LEFT JOIN uied_category c ON c.id = w.category_id
       WHERE w.is_delete = 0
       ORDER BY w.is_pinned DESC, w.click_count DESC, w.is_hot DESC, w.is_featured DESC, w.update_time DESC, w.id DESC
